== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Blobs|Aggressive creature strategies#Blob}}

=== Area of effect ===
Blobs will stretch slightly before compressing and releasing a cloud of poisonous gas 4 meters in radius, applying the [[Poison]] status (90 [[Damage types#Poison|Poison]] damage). Despite visual appearances, the cloud does not actually persist and only hits once. This ability can be used when a player is within 2 meters, and it has a cooldown of 2 seconds.

