==Notes==

*Blobs can follow players out to the ocean and jump into boats.
*Entering a [[Sunken Crypt]] and leaving Blobs alive there will count towards spawn caps effectively suppressing their spawns in a large area (including the [[Forsaken power|Bonemass ability]]).

